<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.init_consumer_at_time('C', '2026-02-11 00:00:00+09');</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>获取锁（循环尝试）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.acquire_consumer_lock('C', 'C-instance-001', 30);</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>拉取一批事件</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
* FROM bus.poll_events('C', 100);</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>处理后提交 offset（max_id 是这批里最�=
��的 id）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.commit_consumer_offset('C', 'C-instance-001', 123456);</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>续租锁（处理较慢时每隔几秒）</span=
></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.renew_consumer_lock('C', 'C-instance-001', 30);</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>释放锁（优雅停机）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.release_consumer_lock('C', 'C-instance-001');</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>定期清理（运维/定时任务）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>安全清=
理：</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.cleanup_consumed(10000);</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>强制保=
留 7 天：</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT
bus.cleanup_older_than(interval '7 days', 10000);</p>

