<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:20.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>四、监控 SQL（核心部分）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>下面是=
生产中真正有价值的监控查询。</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:20.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>1️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> 当前积压量（每个消费者）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>c.consumer_name,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>(<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>        </span>SELECT COUNT(*)<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>        </span>FROM bus.event_log e=
<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>        </span>WHERE e.id &gt;
c.last_event_id<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>          </span>AND (e.target_sy=
stem =3D
c.consumer_name OR e.target_system IS NULL)<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>) AS backlog_count<br>
FROM bus.consumer_registry c;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:20.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>2️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> 最大 ID 滞后</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>consumer_name,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>(SELECT MAX(id) FROM bus.eve=
nt_log) -
last_event_id AS id_lag<br>
FROM bus.consumer_registry;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>说明：=
</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>表示落后多少=
条事件</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:20.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>3️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> 时间滞后（最重要）</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>c.consumer_name,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>now() - MAX(e.created_at) AS
time_lag<br>
FROM bus.consumer_registry c<br>
LEFT JOIN bus.event_log e<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>ON e.id =3D c.last_event_id<br>
GROUP BY c.consumer_name;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>表示：=
</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>当前消费者落=
后多少时间</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:20.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>4️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> Retry 队列积压</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>consumer_name,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>COUNT(*) AS retry_backlog,<b=
r>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>MIN(next_retry_at) AS
next_due<br>
FROM bus.event_retry<br>
GROUP BY consumer_name;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:20.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>5️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> Deadletter 数量</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>consumer_name,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>COUNT(*) AS
deadletter_count<br>
FROM bus.event_deadletter<br>
GROUP BY consumer_name;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:20.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>6️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> 当前处理性能</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>SELECT<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>consumer_name,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>total_processed,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>total_success,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>total_failed,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>total_retry,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>total_deadletter,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>avg_processing_ms,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>last_processing_ms,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>updated_at<br>
FROM bus.consumer_metrics_current;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3Den=
-US>&nbsp;</p>

