<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>                    </s=
pan>EXTRACT(YEAR FROM
v_target)::INT,<br>
<span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>                    </s=
pan>EXTRACT(MONTH FROM
v_target)::INT<br>
