ld;
  font-family:asu-cjk-code'> 实时运行指标表</span></p>
  <p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt' lang=3D=
en-US>CREATE
  TABLE bus.consumer_metrics_current (<br>
    <span style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>consumer_name<span
