     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>只影响当前已=
有表</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>不影响未来新=
创建的表</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:18.0pt'><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>4️⃣</span><span style=3D'font-weight:bold;
font-family:asu-cjk-code'> FROM PUBLIC</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>这里是=
关键。</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:16.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>PUBLIC 是什么？</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>PUBLIC 是
PostgreSQL 的一个特殊“隐式角色”：</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>所有数据库用=
户都自动属于 PUBLIC</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>你无法删除 PU=
BLIC</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>它代表“所有=
用户”</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>也就是=
说：</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>GRANT SEL=
ECT ON
table TO PUBLIC;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>等价于=
：</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-siz=
e:
11.0pt'>所有数据库用户都可以 SELECT 这张表。</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:20.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>二、这条语句实际效果</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>执行后=
：</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;margin-left:.375in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-siz=
e:
11.0pt'>所有数据库用户将失去对 bus schema 下所有表的直接�=
��问权限。</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>即：</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>不能 SELECT</spa=
n></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>不能 INSERT</spa=
n></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>不能 UPDATE</spa=
n></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>不能 DELETE</spa=
n></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>除非：=
</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>单独 GRANT 给�=
�个 role</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:20.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>三、为什么要这样做？</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>在你的=
架构中：</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>表应该只由 bu=
s_owner 管理</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>应用只能通过=
函数访问</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>函数使用 SECUR=
ITY DEFINER</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>如果不=
 revoke：</p>

<ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
 margin-bottom:0in'>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>任何数据库用=
户都可能直接读写 event_log</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>绕过 offset 机�=
��</span></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>绕过锁</span></=
li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>绕过 retry</span=
></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>绕过死信</span=
></li>
 <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle'><span
     style=3D'font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>直接 DELETE 数�=
��</span></li>
</ul>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>这是非=
常危险的。</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:20.0pt'><span
style=3D'font-weight:bold'>四、典型安全模型</span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>推荐做=
法：</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>--
收紧默认权限<br>
REVOKE ALL ON SCHEMA bus FROM PUBLIC;<br>
REVOKE ALL ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA bus FROM PUBLIC;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:asu-cjk-code;font-size:11.0pt'>--
应用只能执行函数<br>
GRANT USAGE ON SCHEMA bus TO app_role;<br>
GRANT EXECUTE ON ALL FUNCTIONS IN SCHEMA bus TO app_role;</p>

